NocturneDecomp
==============

This repository holds three kinds of content, and only the first is licensed
here. The distinction is not a formality: a decompilation cannot grant rights
over the work it was derived from.


What this licence covers
------------------------

The original work in this repository — everything written for this project
rather than recovered from a binary:

    annotations/nocedit.exe/pseudocode/shims/    the compatibility layer
    annotations/nocedit.exe/pseudocode/main/     the hand-written entry point
    cmake/                                       toolchains and build logic
    scripts/                                     the Bash and Python tooling
    docs/                                        the project documentation
    research/                                    the investigations and findings
    spec/                                        the Watcom processor specs
    CMakeLists.txt, CMakePresets.json, build.sh, run.sh, debug.sh

Permission to use, copy, modify, and/or distribute this software for any
purpose with or without fee is hereby granted.

THE SOFTWARE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" AND THE AUTHOR DISCLAIMS ALL WARRANTIES WITH
REGARD TO THIS SOFTWARE INCLUDING ALL IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND
