INDIRECT, OR CONSEQUENTIAL DAMAGES OR ANY DAMAGES WHATSOEVER RESULTING FROM
LOSS OF USE, DATA OR PROFITS, WHETHER IN AN ACTION OF CONTRACT, NEGLIGENCE OR
OTHER TORTIOUS ACTION, ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH THE USE OR
PERFORMANCE OF THIS SOFTWARE.

(This is the BSD Zero Clause Licence, SPDX identifier 0BSD.)


What it does not cover
----------------------

**The reconstructed source.** Everything under `annotations/*/pseudocode/src/`,
together with the exported headers, disassembly, type data and reports beside
it, is derived from the original Nocturne binaries. It describes someone else's
copyrighted program, and no licence granted here extends to it. The contributors
to this project hold no rights in that material and grant none.

**Game data.** The PODs, backdrops, models, sounds, video and the original
executables are not in this repository, are not required to build it, and are
not distributed with it. A release archive contains the engine; whoever runs it
supplies their own copy of the game.

What this project is for
------------------------

Understanding the engine and getting it running on modern systems. It is a
research and preservation effort and is not a way to obtain the game.
